msgstr "{actor} が {category} に {channel} を作成しました"

#. Activity log summary when a forum channel was created. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new channel, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogForumPresentation.ts
msgid "{actor} created the forum channel {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} がフォーラムチャンネル {channel} を作成しました"

#. Activity log summary when a forum channel was created inside a category. {actor} is the member who made the change. {channel} is the new channel and {category} the category that holds it, both shown as channel chips.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogForumPresentation.ts
msgid "{actor} created the forum channel {channel} in {category}"
msgstr "{actor} がフォーラムチャンネル {channel} を {category} に作成しました"

#. Activity log summary for a new invite link when its channel was not recorded. {actor} is the member who created the invite, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {code} is the invite code, shown as boxed text.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogInviteWebhookMessages.ts
msgid "{actor} created the invite {code}"
msgstr "{actor} が招待 {code} を作成しました"

#. Activity log summary for a new invite link. {actor} is the member who created the invite, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {code} is the invite code, shown as boxed text. {channel} is the channel the invite leads to, shown as a channel chip.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogInviteWebhookMessages.ts
